msgid "Adapter: it did not answer ({1}), trying again"
msgstr "Adaptateur : pas de réponse ({1}), nouvel essai"

msgid "Adapter: not found. Plug in its black USB plug."
msgstr "Adaptateur : introuvable. Branchez sa prise USB noire."

msgid "Press buttons on a controller in the adapter to see them here. In a game that supports the GameCube controller, the adapter's controllers fill the ports that have none plugged in."
msgstr "Appuyez sur les boutons d'une manette reliée à l'adaptateur pour les tester ici. Dans un jeu compatible GameCube, ses manettes occupent les ports vides."

msgid "This IOS has no USB HID (IOS{1}). Choose IOS 58 or a d2x cIOS as the Menu IOS."
msgstr "Cet IOS ne gère pas le USB HID (IOS{1}). Choisissez l'IOS 58 ou un cIOS d2x comme IOS du menu."

